  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Humanitarian Agency - Stronger humanitarian action in Africa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">African Humanitarian Agency - Stronger humanitarian action in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the intervention is that the &quot;Humanitarian Affairs Division of the African Union Commission is enabled to effectively implement the establishment and operationalisation of AfHA.&quot; This overall objective is underpinned by two outcomes, that are:

- Improving the knowledge base and strengthening the decision-making support for effective operationalization of AfHA.

- Enhance the capacity and tools for harmonization of Disaster Risk Management across Member States through AfHAs operational framework.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let med insatsen &#xe4;r att &quot;avdelningen f&#xf6;r humanit&#xe4;ra fr&#xe5;gor
vid Afrikanska unionens kommission ska kunna genomf&#xf6;ra inr&#xe4;ttandet och
operationaliseringen av AfHA&quot; p&#xe5; ett effektivt s&#xe4;tt. Detta &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l st&#xf6;ds
av tv&#xe5; resultat:
&#xad; F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra kunskapsbasen och st&#xe4;rka beslutsst&#xf6;det f&#xf6;r en effektiv
operationalisering av AfHA.
&#xad; F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra kapaciteten och verktygen f&#xf6;r harmonisering av katastrofriskhantering
i medlemsstaterna genom AFHA:s operativa ram.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the intervention is that the &quot;Humanitarian Affairs Division
of the African Union Commission is enabled to effectively implement the
establishment and operationalisation of AfHA.&quot; This overall objective is
underpinned by two outcomes, that are:
&#xad; Improving the knowledge base and strengthening the decision&#xad;making support
for effective operationalization of AfHA.
&#xad; Enhance the capacity and tools for harmonisation of Disaster Risk
Management across Member States through AfHA&#x2019;s operational framework.</narrative>
  </description>
